ValidateTermModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Validates a block terminator: op must be one of Return/Branch/Jump/Call. Returns 1 on success, 0 otherwise.
    Provides: ValidateTerm(term) -> ok.
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../ValidateTerm/ValidateTerm.sir).
